                                            "a native or inhabitant of the ancient city of Miletus in Asia Minor."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "historical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a759b2c3-29df-30cc-9639-16e914edd3d0",
                                        "entry_id": "0433f014-c43d-3bd7-a0d5-3f3c647e5a07",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "a follower of the Milesian school of philosophy founded by Thales"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Milesian",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "98c1ff46-1438-3505-9522-1e276018b546",
                                        "entry_id": "b3f61eac-daef-3131-93e5-00f445270703",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pertaining to Miletus or its inhabitants."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5363f77d-73d7-4d34-885e-a6c9fd306730",
                                                "sense_id": "98c1ff46-1438-3505-9522-1e276018b546",
                                                "text": "I commend the Milesian wench, who seeing Thales the Philosopher continually ammusing himselfe in the contemplation of heavens-wide-bounding vault, and ever holding his eyes aloft, laid something in his way to make him stumble[…]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Milesian",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9d681dab-8c05-39ca-8283-4116372aee83",
                                        "entry_id": "1e277b35-c58f-3201-86a1-0df1694d0547",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pertaining to Milesius or his people; Irish."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e50e4016-cc9f-4d2c-bb53-4e3f88be4ab4",
                                                "sense_id": "9d681dab-8c05-39ca-8283-4116372aee83",
                                                "text": "My father was the youngest son of a numerous family, all Irish, sprung from a very ancient and honourable stock, being of Milesian descent […] ."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3a932be6-265d-48a1-9ab3-2b39e4cd0a5e",
                                                "sense_id": "9d681dab-8c05-39ca-8283-4116372aee83",
                                                "text": "[…] exultingly cried Lord Carhampton, stealing an underlook at Maurice O'Driscoll, whom ^([sic]) he knew was wont to boast of his Milesian lineage; […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Milesian",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
